;box-sizing:border-box;width:730px;height:104px;border-style:solid;border-color:transparent;margin:0\">16 activity pages, made from the same pictures as {N}’s Mission Control. Use the Wipe &#38; Play pages again and again: slip each one into a sheet protector (or laminate it) and use a dry-erase marker, then wipe clean with a tissue. The two Print &#38; Play pages are for paper, with dot markers (or stickers), scissors and glue.</div>"}]},"img/pages/space-little-activity.webp":{"w":816,"h":1056,"s":[{"x":408,"y":93.2,"w":730,"h":20,"html":"<div style=\"font-family:Nunito, sans-serif;font-size:14.6667px;font-weight:400;line-height:normal;text-align:center;color:rgb(102, 112, 143);text-underline-offset:auto;margin-top:4.8px;margin-bottom:19.2px;box-sizing:border-box;box-sizing:border-box;width:730px;height:20px;border-style:solid;border-color:transparent;margin:0\">Find every picture in {N}’s Mission Control. Circle them, then write how many.</div>"}]},"img/gallery/space/activity-3.webp":{"w":816,"h":1056,"s":[{"x":408,"y":93.2,"w":730,"h":20,"html":"<div style=\"font-family:Nunito, sans-serif;font-size:14.6667px;font-weight:400;line-height:normal;text-align:center;color:rgb(102, 112, 143);text-underline-offset:auto;margin-top:4.8px;margin-bottom:19.2px;box-sizing:border-box;box-sizing:border-box;width:730px;height:20px;border-style:solid;border-color:transparent;margin:0\">A secret message for {N}! Find each picture in the code key and write its letter in the box below it.</div>"}]},"img/gallery/space/activity-4.webp":{"w":816,"h":1056,"s":[{"x":408,"y":93.2,"w":730,"h":20,"html":"<div style=\"font-family:Nunito, sans-serif;font-size:14.6667px;font-weight:400;line-height:normal;text-align:center;color:rgb(102, 112, 143);text-underline-offset:auto;margin-top:4.8px;margin-bottom:19.2px;box-sizing:border-box;box-sizing:border-box;width:730px;height:20px;border-style:solid;border-color:transparent;margin:0\">Color each square to match its number. What’s hiding at {N}’s M